><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)"><strong>Without these nutrients, your dog's gut slowly breaks down. </strong>And when the gut breaks down, everything else follows, which is exactly why the next point matters more than most owners realise.</span></p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="6b46983d-d3ab-490a-8b51-a211aa5a008a" class="r-z0kcv2"><div data-rid="d46cdd87-8a07-4896-95d0-7c17407a6924" class="r-11f3t2u"><div data-rid="b621681e-682b-41c6-9382-757a1b6bf0b3" class="r-1gx050s alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>2. Understand What's Really Happening Inside Their Gut</h3></span></div><div data-rid="08004dd7-d45a-4d0b-a279-498168276a55" class="r-1vad5gx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)"><strong>Your dog's gut controls almost everything.</strong> Digestion. Immunity. Skin health. Energy. Joint function. <strong>Even how long they live.</strong></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">80% of their immune system lives in the gut. When it's balanced, the body works. When it's not, the body breaks down. Studies on dogs over 10 consistently show the same pattern, <strong>the ones with healthy gut bacteria live significantly longer</strong> and stay active further into old age.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Right now, if your dog eats processed food, their gut is missing the three nutrients it needs most. And your dog has been showing you the signs, you just didn't know what to look for.</span></p></span></div><button data-rid="41bf7fc5-b499-4cbe-9410-72ea7b017c97" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-15opi0t alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="8498cf35-ac5a-4fa1-ae7c-00339b01a7a2" class="r-aagsz6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>To the solution -></strong></p></span></div></button></div><picture data-rid="0de42373-3d5d-46d5-81da-07586b676eed" class="r-a8gwqs"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/7157b94b-d7d8-4533-8ed8-bf75ee7b61da?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/b35a2703-e657-44d3-ad83-ce46a82ecc03?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/b35a2703-e657-44d3-ad83-ce46a82ecc03?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/b35a2703-e657-44d3-ad83-ce46a82ecc03" alt="Illustration of a dog&#x27;s digestive system before and after; red and green sections labeled." class="r-bq2r6u" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="7420e917-2e9c-4bf8-90ac-0682a1112962" class="r-1lzbtoa"><div data-rid="970871e9-1530-4001-a947-2257d0561835" class="r-80s3fp"><div data-rid="b7251492-c3ee-4f95-9164-65f035d6c498" class="r-1u441n6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>3. Recognise What Your Dog Has Been Trying To Tell You</p></span></div><div data-rid="3d23a205-f3fd-40b9-b665-419896ea0a01" class="r-z8skry alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">The <strong>grass eating.</strong> The <strong>paw licking.</strong> The <strong>scratching. </strong>The <strong>dull coat. </strong>The <strong>low energy.</strong> The<strong> stiff joints.</strong> The <strong>digestive issues.</strong></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">These aren't random. They're not "just what dogs do." Every one of these traces back to a gut that's been stripped of what it needs.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Left unaddressed, these signals don't just stay the same, they get worse.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">The<strong> inflammation builds.</strong> The immune system weakens. And <strong>your dog ages faster </strong>than they should. If you want them to live longer, this is the first thing you need to <strong>stop ignoring.</strong></span></p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="bc802314-57df-4b1d-86c3-30bf0cc6c426" class="r-1gvwrzq"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/09cca950-88ef-43bc-b3ed-0dc19e28bcec?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/09cca950-88ef-43bc-b3ed-0dc19e28bcec?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/09cca950-88ef-43bc-b3ed-0dc19e28bcec?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/09cca950-88ef-43bc-b3ed-0dc19e28bcec" class="r-bkwt3e" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="07d0f27a-e929-4cf5-bcdb-dbbb7cc26288" class="r-fzfh1f"><picture data-rid="b61fd96f-951a-41d8-b947-aac1e107768b" class="r-1uz2lq5"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/30ed8e52-af01-4bba-93d8-81ea477b6287?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/86621297-d6df-450d-a626-0f9614792e82?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/86621297-d6df-450d-a626-0f9614792e82?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/86621297-d6df-450d-a626-0f9614792e82" class="r-d2d2w6" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="dd5f7111-f534-4f39-876c-d1a5433c9726" class="r-gw42u4"><div data-rid="e99ad597-ac88-4139-928d-d16dece8dba5" class="r-1va97yq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>4. Stop Wasting Money On Solutions That Don't Fix The Problem</p></span></div><div data-rid="cfaa64f0-7a26-45d5-8bfa-60359e5e73d3" class="r-1op6q3c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Apoquel. Cytopoint. Medicated shampoos. Premium kibble. Cheap probiotic powders. Allergy treats.</p><p><br></p><p>Every one of these treats the surface. Not one reaches the gut. That's why symptoms always return and nothing permanently changes.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>If you want your dog to live longer, stop managing symptoms </strong>and <strong>start fixing the root cause. </strong>What that root cause is, and how to actually fix it, is what separates the dogs who thrive from the ones who slowly decline.</p><p><br></p></span></div><button data-rid="104a8dae-d8c7-4e25-bea9-54fd0542d5f0" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-1yl00h0 alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="fcd40dbf-c66e-46e1-94a7-15134133a73e" class="r-li1wxz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>To the solution -></strong></p></span></div></button></div></div><div data-rid="039ff5a4-b781-41d6-ad83-ab3e93f931c6" class="r-1rbakk2"><div data-rid="afd7b6a8-2895-49f3-9f7a-3f942f9ece5e" class="r-201q5c"><div data-rid="695eef85-796a-49ff-b48f-b6cff28057b4" class="r-lj4h63 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>5. Give Them What's Actually Been Missing</p></span></div><div data-rid="bfd8a7d0-f480-4388-833e-89e015e9d7ff" class="r-1mtxoim alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Dr. James Whitford</strong>, a <strong>veterinary nutritionist</strong> studied why <strong>some dogs live dramatically longer</strong> than others. Every time, the answer came back to one thing, <strong>gut health.</strong></p><p><br></p><p>He developed a single daily chew called <strong>VitalPaws</strong> that restores the three nutrients kibble destroys. <strong>500 million probiotics,</strong> the clinical dose, not the 1-2 million in cheap supplements. <strong>Wild Alaskan Salmon Oil</strong> for <strong>real omega-3s.</strong> A complete <strong>B-vitamin complex.</strong> <strong>Glucosamine. Plus 12 natural active ingredients. </strong>Cold-pressed to keep everything alive. Every batch independently tested by Eurofins.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>One chew. </strong>Everything their food is missing. At doses that actually work.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="fdd81615-d633-476d-8e1b-4257430d7ee7" class="r-1r9uvt4"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/9742f8a2-5d9d-4f83-bce8-8ffeb24548a9?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/9742f8a2-5d9d-4f83-bce8-8ffeb24548a9?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/9742f8a2-5d9d-4f83-bce8-8ffeb24548a9?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/9742f8a2-5d9d-4f83-bce8-8ffeb24548a9" class="r-tyconz" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="9367bac0-8a81-48b2-81ff-fed7d9a84dd1" class="r-7nfy3a"><picture data-rid="80a03a6f-bffb-42e0-b6a1-50374a736e72" class="r-gqfwkb"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/78d97139-3b3b-40ae-9dd9-7551a577d6cd?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/78d97139-3b3b-40ae-9dd9-7551a577d6cd?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/78d97139-3b3b-40ae-9dd9-7551a577d6cd?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/62fa55aa-b4ed-4ba8-9030-d0192c8e179d/78d97139-3b3b-40ae-9dd9-7551a577d6cd" class="r-1fzeksg" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="754cc409-0ed2-45fb-b3fe-7b3c2b65f028" class="r-116eyf6"><div data-rid="3686dabf-74c5-46de-acc2-1e463a6bee11" class="r-1i35fax alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>6. Start Before The Damage Gets Worse</p></span></div><div data-rid="7fcaeb2e-5518-4ac2-bb55-a8de4253be41" class="r-1buih0a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every day the <strong>gut stays unbalanced,</strong> the <strong>inflammation builds.</strong> The immune system weakens. The joints stiffen. The body <strong>ages faster</strong> than it should.</p><p><br></p><p>This isn't something that fixes itself. It gets worse. Slowly. Quietly. Until one day you realise your dog isn't the same anymore and you can't pinpoint when it changed.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>The owners who act early</strong> don't just see better results. They <strong>get more time.</strong> And you can't put a price on that.</p><p><br></p></span></div><button data-rid="8dae6aa9-bf26-4941-a1c9-76953fea1857" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-4oawyk alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="7af41e66-797c-4cd5-a1b5-86bedecbd7c7" class="r-qlr2xm alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>To the solution -></strong></p></span></div></button></div></div><div data-rid="78c2abd5-6aa5-4c95-ae9f-6b4ab02639a5" class="r-16zgzbt"><div data-rid="5719b7f4-0b54-44fe-a8c0-eabecccc07b2" class="r-1rh37c1"><div data-rid="8a42e95b-771e-42a5-ab16-afcd4fda65b2" class="r-1tao2mr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>7. Give Them The Chance To Be With You For As Long As Possible</p></span></div><div data-rid="5a5bfadc-5ffc-437e-9a8e-36d44a32f194" class="r-rae8u6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>That's what this is really about. Not supplements. Not ingredients. Not gut health.</p><p><br></p><p>Time. <strong>More time with your dog. </strong>Good time. Years where they're running and playing and comfortable and happy, not just slowly fading. That's what every owner wants.</p><p><br></p><p>And the science is clear: gut health is the single biggest thing most owners aren't addressing.</p><p><strong>Your dog can't make this choice. You can.</strong></p></span></di