e-b9bc-2e9bcfbb7938" class="r-8covfg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long until I start seeing the benefits?</p></span></div><div data-rid="31f289d6-ed7e-42a8-90d3-373309e3dfbc" class="r-owmz22"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rik32:"><div data-rid="bdea5083-bfd4-40d2-b223-26fde0553b4f" class="r-wtlqlh"><div data-rid="f6d4a49b-801d-42de-aa91-1dad693ba4c5" class="r-rmktb3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The benefits that most dogs feel—less itching, more activity, better mood—are just bonuses to improving their long-term health. If taken consistently on a daily basis, most dogs will start to see positive effects in about 6-8 weeks.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="38e6c1c2-fe77-42fc-84f6-ec4579e7906c" class="r-xbpej4" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="06d553ca-db55-459c-b676-16217ad93da7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rmk32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1aikyrn"><div data-rid="fa261fa8-0572-40a2-9c5d-32f8990b5d6c" class="r-1wzwpju alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How many chews come in a jar? </p></span></div><div data-rid="12e559d1-74bd-4f0e-9bc3-b0e66dea7088" class="r-lga3nw"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" 